	<!-- Cheese making -->
	
	<!-- EN: Select Milk to press in the cheese press. Different milks might produce different types of cheese. -->
  <VCE_InsertMilkDesc>给奶酪压制器选择原乳。不同种类的原乳可能会制成不同种类的奶酪。</VCE_InsertMilkDesc>
	<!-- EN: Select Milk -->
