	<!-- Condiment stats (using code from AnimalBehaviours) -->
	
	<!-- EN: Condiment Effects -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffects>调料效果</VCE_CondimentEffects>
	<!-- EN: Acting as condiment -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsTitle>作为调料</VCE_CondimentEffectsTitle>
	<!-- EN: Agave nectar is a thin and semi-sweet nectar, known for its healing and anti-inflammatory properties. Consuming meals that include this condiment gives a 15% immunity gain speed boost for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsAgave>龙舌兰蜜是一种细腻又轻甜的花蜜，拥有疗伤和消炎的作用。食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加15%的免疫获取速度。</VCE_CondimentEffectsAgave>
	<!-- EN: Sugar is easily converted into energy by the body, which may result in a nice burst of energy. Consuming meals that include this condiment increases moving stat by 15% for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsSugar>蔗糖能被人体迅速转化为能量，可以让人精力充沛。食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加15%的移动能力。</VCE_CondimentEffectsSugar>
	<!-- EN: A variety of aromatic and pungent spices. Consuming meals that include this condiment increases manipulation stat by 10% for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsSpices>一系列又香又辣的香料。食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加10%的工作能力。</VCE_CondimentEffectsSpices>
	<!-- EN: Consuming meals that include this condiment increases mood by 5 for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsSalt>食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加5点心情。</VCE_CondimentEffectsSalt>
	<!-- EN: Mayonnaise, while terrible for you, adds a pleasing tang and is very calorically dense. Consuming meals that include this condiment lowers hunger rate by 15% for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsMayo>虽然对身体不好，蛋黄酱能量价值很高。食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里减少15%的饥饿值增长。</VCE_CondimentEffectsMayo>
	<!-- EN: Consuming meals that include this condiment increases mood by 10 for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsJelly>食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加10点心情。</VCE_CondimentEffectsJelly>
	<!-- EN: Consuming meals that include this condiment creates a smokeleaf high without addiction risks. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsButter>食用带有该调料的食物会产生大麻亢奋效果，但不会有上瘾的风险。</VCE_CondimentEffectsButter>
	<!-- EN: Consuming meals that include this condiment increases mood by 7 for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsSyrup>食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加7点心情。</VCE_CondimentEffectsSyrup>
	<!-- EN: Consuming meals that include this condiment increases manipulation by 1% for 12 hours. The colonist will be resurrected if it is killed during that time. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsNanites>食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加1%的工作能力。在此期间如果食用者被杀则会复活。</VCE_CondimentEffectsNanites>
	<!-- EN: Consuming meals that include this condiment increases mood by 3 for 12 hours. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsKetchup>食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里增加3点心情。</VCE_CondimentEffectsKetchup>
	<!-- EN: While particularly strong hot sauces hurt at first, they are known to numb pain and work up a warm sweat shortly after consumption. Consuming meals that include this condiment boosts pain resistance by 15% and cold temperature resistance by 10ºC for 12 hours. Mood will be reduced by 3. -->
  <VCE_CondimentEffectsSauce>刚入口会很感觉辣，但在之后会让人身体发热，还能麻痹痛觉。食用带有该调料的食物会在12小时里减少3点心情，增加15%的疼痛抗性和10ºC的温度下限。</VCE_CondimentEffectsSauce>
	
